    "voice": "produce_events/600700401/6007004010020"
  },
  {
    "id": 6007004010030,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "どんな三峰でも理解しようとしてくれて\r\n見守って、支えて、励ましてくれて",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600700401/6007004010030"
  },
  {
    "id": 6007004010040,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "だからこそ──\r\n情けないところなんか見せたくないって思う相手",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600700401/6007004010040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……──そうか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そういうところを見せてくれたって構わないっていう\r\nファン心理もあるんだけどなぁ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6007004010050,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "あははっ\r\nそりゃあまぁ、三峰だってファンやってるからわかるけど",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600700401/6007004010050"
  },
  {
    "id": 6007004010060,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "──でも、大事な人の前ではかっこつけたいじゃん",
    "charAnim1": "wink",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600700401/6007004010060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……そうだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "じゃあ、きっちり見せてきてくれ\r\n結華のかっこいいところ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6007004010070,
